#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1453 expect=noViolation domain=DI
#note "FRESH, DISCRIMINATING. No class= on the dataset line — the twin declares none. The two rows share the tuple (DISEQ=1, DOMAIN=DI, SPDEVID=\"\") and — since EC-53 / Fix #143 made \"\" a REAL key component — the uniqueness leaf alone WOULD report both. They stay silent only because the author's not empty(SPDEVID) conjunct gates each row first. Pins the guard as load-bearing rather than decorative, on the one operator where the empty-key contract changed. If it fires, either the guard or the EC-53 contract moved — escalate, do not rewrite."
#expectViolationCount 0
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DI
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col SPDEVID  type=Char label="Sponsor Device Identifier"
col DISEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col DIPARMCD type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Code"
col DIPARM   type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Name"
col DIVAL    type=Char label="Device Identifier Element Value"
---
S1 | DI |  | 1 | DEVTYPE | Device Type  | PUMP
S1 | DI |  | 1 | MANUF   | Manufacturer | ACME
